  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: 500 Rummy. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '500 Rummy: first to 500 points wins. Melds (sets and runs) score positive; unmelded cards in hand count negative. Key twist: you may draw any card from the discard pile but must take all cards above it and meld the drawn card immediately. 2-8 players; 52 cards plus 2 jokers.',
    objective: 'Score the most points by creating and protecting valuable melds.',
    gameplay: 'After bidding and dealing, players draw from the deck or discard area, make or hold melds, and discard. Melds can be captured or stolen under Rooky rules, blending Rummy flow with Rook-deck conventions.',
